comment.narrative:
CSCI obtained the participation of local CSOs in village consultation committees to reduce the rate of degradation of national parks in the project areas through the following accepted recommendations:
1) the setting up of 15 sub-prefectural committees in 15 villages close to the targeted parks;
2) The integration of women, youth and people with disabilities in the 15 consultation committees in the 15 regions;
3) Involvement of 7 neighbouring CSO partners in the follow-up of the proposed advocacy 7 coastal communities.
